{"id":"spokojstvie","lemma":"спокойствие","pos":"noun","rank":1787,"glosses":["calmness (the state of being calm; tranquillity; silence)","composure (calmness of mind or matter, self-possession)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/de/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"спокойствия","plural":"спокойствия"},"examples":[{"text":"Я думаю, нам важно сохранять спокойствие.","en":"I think it's important for us to stay calm.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"importantly"},{"g":"to save"},null]},{"text":"Чего я хочу, так это мира и спокойствия.","en":"What I want is some peace and quiet.","words":[{"g":"what for? why?"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"peace","l":"мир"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Том пытался сохранить спокойствие.","en":"Tom tried to keep calm.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to attempt, to try","l":"пытаться"},{"g":"to save"},null]},{"text":"Просто сохраняй спокойствие.","en":"Just stay calm.","words":[{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to save","l":"сохранять"},null]},{"text":"Том был нарушителем спокойствия.","en":"Tom was a troublemaker.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]}]}